# GitHub's language bar should describe the configuration rather than what it
# renders. QML is the shell's presentation, and the HTML is an archived design
# prototype, kept as a design artifact rather than as source.
#
# This is a Linguist override only - it changes GitHub's statistics and nothing
# else. Git still tracks, diffs, merges and blames these files as text, and
# reviewed diffs are unaffected. (`linguist-generated` would also collapse them
# in diffs; that is deliberately not what this is.)
*.qml linguist-detectable=false
*.html linguist-detectable=false
